{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And they shall send out from the camp.</b> We have heard the warning; from where is the punishment? Scripture says: ״ואיש אשר יטמא ולא יתחטא״ etc." "<b>Every leper and every zav and every one impure through a corpse.</b> They are three impure persons, and corresponding to them three sendings-out are written. And all of these have seven-day impurity and require sending out, which is not so in the case of one with a seminal emission."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:29.514443306Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}